# Input graph for RDFLib__timefuncs__tests_functions_test_finishes.py__test_finishes.
#
# `test_finishes` loads its OWN fixture, at a path it hardcodes:
# `tests_dir / "data" / "finishes.ttl"` where `tests_dir = Path(__file__).parent`
# -- so the real file both original.py and translated.ldpy read is
# `data/finishes.ttl`, at the exact same relative path as in the upstream
# repository (RDFLib/timefuncs@dd3bde8727, tests/functions/data/finishes.ttl),
# copied here VERBATIM, unmodified, with no path-fixing code needed on either
# side (see meta.json).
#
# This file mirrors data/finishes.ttl for documentation/protocol consistency
# (INSTRUCTIONS_403 SS3: "le fixture est un acte de traduction a part entiere");
# it is not read directly by either version -- see driver.py.  It is the real
# upstream test fixture, not one written for this study: it already covers
# several solutions (a01, a03-a06, a08), a case a query type mismatch rules
# out (a02, an Instant not an Interval), transitive chains (a04, a05), and
# datatype-compared beginnings/ends (a06).
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .
@prefix : <https://w3id.org/timefuncs/testdata/finishes/> .

:a01 a time:Interval .
:b01 a time:Interval .

:a02 a time:Instant .
:b02 a time:Interval .

:a03 a time:Interval .
:b03 a time:Interval .

:a04 a time:Interval .
:b04 a time:Interval .

:a05 a time:Interval .
:b05 a time:Interval .

:a06 a time:Interval .
:b06 a time:Interval .

:a07 a time:Interval .
:b07 a time:Interval .

:a08 a time:ProperInterval .
:b08 a time:Interval .

:a09 a time:Interval .
:b09 a time:ProperInterval .

:a10 a time:ProperInterval .
:b10 a time:ProperInterval .

:a01 time:intervalFinishes :b01 .

# fails due to a being of type time:Instant
:a02 time:intervalFinishes :b02 .

:b03 time:intervalFinishedBy :a03 .

:a04 time:intervalFinishes :x04 .
:x04 time:intervalFinishes :y04 .
:y04 time:intervalFinishes :b04 .

:a05 time:intervalFinishes :x05 .
:y05 time:intervalFinishedBy :x05 .
:z05 time:intervalFinishedBy :y05 .
:z05 time:intervalFinishes :w05 .
:b05 time:intervalFinishedBy :w05 .

:a06
    time:hasBeginning [ time:inXSDDateTimeStamp "2021-07-29T00:00:01Z" ] ;
    time:hasEnd [ time:inXSDDateTimeStamp "2021-07-29T00:00:02Z" ] ;
.
:b06
    time:hasBeginning [ time:inXSDDateTimeStamp "2021-07-29T00:00:00Z" ] ;
    time:hasEnd [ time:inXSDDateTimeStamp "2021-07-29T00:00:02Z" ] ;
.

